<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
远处神殿的钟声穿过街巷悠悠传来，余音清澈而庄严。风中飘落几片洁白的花瓣，落在你们相牵的手背上。
<br><br>
<<templeicon>><<link [[十指相扣 (0:08)|MP Event Temple Blessing Pray]]>><<pass 8>><<stress -10>><<trauma -6>><<purity 3>><</link>><<lstress>><<ltrauma>><<glove>>
