:: MP Event Temple Blessing Pray [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
你们在悠扬的钟声里十指紧扣，闭上眼睛许下永远守望相助的心愿。当睁开眼时，你们恰好撞进彼此温柔的目光里，心中涌起一股难以言喻的宁静与力量。
<<run window.dolmp && window.dolmp.notifyInteractEffect && window.dolmp.notifyInteractEffect("temple_blessing_pray", 10, -10, -6, 0, 0, "在神殿钟声下与你十指紧扣共同祈愿", { love: 1, trust: 1 })>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<set _mpExitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Wolf Street")>><<link [[继续|_mpExitPas]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Event Temple Blessing Kiss [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">>
<<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<promiscuity1>>
趁着同伴虔诚地闭上双眼默念心愿，你踮起脚尖一口吻在了对方温软的唇上。同伴惊愕地睁开眼睛，随即耳根通红地反手揽住你的腰，加深了这个带着些许恶作剧意味的吻：「我刚刚许下的心愿……就是能一直这样吻你。」
<<run window.dolmp && window.dolmp.notifyInteractEffect && window.dolmp.notifyInteractEffect("temple_blessing_kiss", 10, -6, -4, 0, 700, "在钟声回荡时偷吻了闭眼祈愿的你", { love: 1, lust: 1, corruption: 1 })>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<set _mpExitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Wolf Street")>><<link [[继续|_mpExitPas]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: 联机会客厅 [nobr exitCheckBypass]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">>
<div id="mp-hub-root">
	<div class="mp-hub-title">联机会客厅</div>
	<div class="mp-hub-desc">
		这里可以查看在线同伴、发起会合、聊天与交换物品。
	</div>
	<div class="mp-hub-body">
		<div class="mp-hub-col">
			<div class="mp-hub-h">在场玩家</div>
			<div id="mp-hub-players" class="mp-list"></div>
		</div>
		<div class="mp-hub-col">
			<div class="mp-hub-h">会客厅聊天</div>
			<div id="mp-hub-log" class="mp-log"></div>
			<div class="mp-hub-input">
				<input id="mp-hub-say" class="mp-input" maxlength="200" placeholder="说点什么…">
				<button id="mp-hub-send" class="mp-mini">发送</button>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
	<div class="mp-back"><<back "离开会客厅">></div>
</div>

